Package: com.samcejko.tikieplus
Name: TikTak+
Version: 0.4.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Unofficial TikTok client for iOS 6 with account sign-in, personal For You, following feed, notifications, own profile and interactions (likes/comments). Needs its helper on your own server.
Maintainer: samcejko
Author: samcejko
Section: Multimedia
Depends: firmware (>= 6.0), firmware (<< 11.0)
